#### So why do people use direction arrays?
It’s just a shorthand to follow the **DRY (Don’t Repeat Yourself)** principle:
1. No repeated code: Notice how the bounds check and maxPath update is copied 4 times in the if-statement version? If you ever need to change that logic (e.g. add a rule that you can’t move to even numbers), you only have to change it once with the array approach, instead of 4 times (which is error-prone).
